        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 11405 Decorative Fancy Door Knob Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Decorative Knob Mortise Lockset is available in Vintage Brass, Vintage Copper, Vintage Copper, Shaded Bronze finishes. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screw-less outside plates.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/decorative-fancy-knob-entry-door-lockset-omnia-d11405\">Omnia D11405</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door knobs, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 11405 Fancy Knob Mortise Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Door Knobs and Trim</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate for all lock bodies, finished to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt by turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob inside and by key outside. The outside knob is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Decorative Fancy Knob Mortise Lockset, Omnia 11405",
                "description": "Omnia 11405 Mortise Lockset - The Decorative Knob Mortise Lockset is available in Vintage Brass, Vintage Copper, Vintage Copper, Shaded Bronze finishes. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screw-less outside plates.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-11405 Decorative Fancy Door Knob Mortise Locksets, Omnia 11405 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #405 door knobs, omnia 405 knobs, decorative knobs, fancy door knobs,"
